 "subs": [
  {
   "text": "Somebody played this free\ndemo for two hundred and\nseventy five hours.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.068,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Half the people who\nreviewed it had already\nput in ten. It's five\nhundred megabytes, and one\nperson in Poland made all\nof it.",
   "start": 4.318,
   "duration": 7.125,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "So I read the file list\nSteam publishes for it.\nThe entire game is one\nfile, eight hundred and\nfifty eight kilobytes.",
   "start": 11.693,
   "duration": 7.046,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The Unity runtime next to\nit is thirty megabytes.\nThe engine is thirty five\ntimes bigger than the\ngame.",
   "start": 18.989,
   "duration": 6.054,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Two scenes in the whole\nbuild. Everything else is\ngenerated.",
   "start": 25.293,
   "duration": 3.52,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And the third party\npackage list is one entry.\nDiscord rich presence.\nThat's it.",
   "start": 29.063,
   "duration": 4.852,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
